| Code | Language | `<html lang>` | hreflang | og:locale |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `me` (default) | Montenegrin | `sr-Latn-ME` | `sr-Latn-ME` | `sr_ME` |
| `en` | English | `en` | `en` | `en_US` |
| `it` | Italian | `it` | `it` | `it_IT` |
| `ru` | Russian | `ru` | `ru` | `ru_RU` |
| `tr` | Turkish | `tr` | `tr` | `tr_TR` |

The switcher shows uppercase codes in this order: **EN, RU, IT, TR, ME**. The native names (**Crnogorski, English, Italiano, Русский, Türkçe**) are read only by screen readers.

