## 12. Translation check script

Implemented in `scripts/check-translations.ts` (run with `npm run i18n:check`). It loads every `messages/*.json`, flattens the keys (`nav.menu`, ...) and lists the keys missing from or extra in each language compared with `me.json`. It exits with code 1 if they differ. `flat` takes `o: object`, not `any`, so ESLint passes.

