## 15. Working rules for the coding agent

- Before changing routes, check section 2 (hard rules) and section 5.
- After every change run `npm run build` and `npm run i18n:check`, and fix errors before reporting done.
- Ask before adding new dependencies.
- Add shadcn components with the CLI (`npx shadcn@latest add <name>`), do not hand-write them.
- When pasting a shadcn space block, replace all its text with `t('...')` calls and its colors with semantic tokens.
- Do not translate into IT/RU/TR on your own for production: copy `me.json` as a placeholder unless asked.
- Never invent business data. Leave a `TODO` and list it in your summary.

